        <h2>Anuradhapura</h2>
        <p >Sri Lanka's first great city, founded over two thousand years ago. Huge white stupas, ancient reservoirs and a sacred fig tree — grown from a cutting of the original Bodhi tree — still draw pilgrims today.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Ruwanwelisaya and Jetavanaramaya stupas</li>
          <li>The Sri Maha Bodhi sacred tree</li>
          <li>Best explored slowly, by bicycle</li>
